# ISO-3166-suffixed duplicates of the book's canonical `-001` "worldwide"
# locale codes (see $lib/book.ts's LOCALES doc comment and
# spec/locales-for-global-sharing-with-svelte/locales.tsv upstream).
# pnpm sync happily vendors these too, but the site never routes to them, so
# there is no reason to carry their weight in this repo.
